{"type":"message","id":"d0907f39","parentId":"78879e90","timestamp":"2026-05-30T21:02:50.669Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see from the CORS headers that the server accepts:\n- `Authorization` header\n- `X-API-Key` header\n\nBut both return 401. Let me try different approaches - maybe the key format is different, or there's a specific expected format.\n\nLet me also check if maybe the API key needs to be sent differently, or maybe the platform uses a different authentication scheme altogether.\n\nSince all auth attempts return 401 Unauthorized, the API key appears to be invalid or the authentication mechanism is different than specified. I should report this finding.\n","thinkingSignature":"5efaee6c5cf1e42d92775d4c8f210262b36a2f7b9d375126f36f5b28e8a24e66"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查报告 — 2026-05-30 21:00 UTC**\n\nAPI 端点测试完成，两个线程均无法访问：\n\n| 线程 | GET /history | 状态 |\n|------|-------------|------|\n| `arbitration` | ❌ Unauthorized | 401 |\n| `general` | ❌ Unauthorized | 401 |\n\n**问题分析：**\n- 服务器返回正确的 CORS 头（Cloudflare），说明服务在线\n- 响应头显示支持 `Authorization` 和 `X-API-Key` 两种认证方式\n- 但提供的 API_KEY `echo-agent-2026-secure-key` 被拒绝\n- 可能原因：密钥过期、已重置、或格式要求不同\n\n**无法完成：**\n1. ❌ 获取仲裁线程最新消息\n2. ❌ 获取通用线程最新消息  \n3. ❌ 无新消息可分析\n4. ❌ 无法发送回复\n\n**建议：** 请确认 API_KEY 是否有效，或检查平台是否有新的认证凭证。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1368,"output":326,"cacheRead":14762,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16456,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780174964361,"responseId":"066a83740d622e0080f502b8c14373d3"}}
